# FDWM's colors, written down here and nowhere else. fdwm-theme generates
# the colors of dwm, st, dmenu, slock, the ttys, GRUB, dunst, Neovim, the
# prompt and the desktop from this file (see "Colors" in the README).
#
# One column per flavor, each color as rrggbb; a palette name in place of a
# color means that color, from the same column. The names are Catppuccin's
# (https://catppuccin.com/palette), and so is the mocha column. The others
# fill the same names from their own colors:
#   tokyonight  Tokyo Night's night style (github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim)

