# What the desktop draws with, so each flavor can pick its own: ui_text is
# the bar's and dmenu's text; ui_accent the selected tag's underline, the
# focused window's border, dmenu's selection, dunst's frame and the
# screenshot outline; ui_border the other windows' borders.
ui_text       lavender  subtext1
ui_accent     lavender  blue
ui_border     lavender  surface2

# The terminal's 16 colors (0-7 normal, 8-15 bright: black, red, green,
# yellow, blue, magenta, cyan, white), text, background and cursor: st uses
# all of them, and the ttys the 16, except that there 0 is the background
# and 7 the text. Tokyo Night's are its own terminal colors.
